          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car vous allez passer le Jourdain pour entrer, pour posséder le pays que l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", votre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", vous donne ; et vous le posséderez, et vous y habiterez.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et vous prendrez garde à pratiquer tous les statuts et les ordonnances que je mets aujourd'hui devant vous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
